===== Notes =====
Youtube video instructions for flashing


[[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KNg7aIAiV-w|Youtube video instructions on flashing]]

Note that once flashed the MR52 will not properly synchronize it's Ethernet interface to a Cisco Catalyst switch port that is a 10/100 port, autodetection is broken.
It WILL properly work with a Cisco Catalyst switch that has gigabit ports.

installing ethtool and setting the port to 100BaseT half-duplex with the command

ethtool -s eth0 speed 100 duplex full autoneg off

will NOT correct the problem even if the Catalyst FastEthernet port is set the same way with autonegotiation turned off.

This problem may also affect other 10/100 hubs and switches.

Note also that the MR52 has 3 radios.  The first radio is a monitoring radio and should not be used.  If very low wifi throughput is observed, check that the 2nd and 3rd radios are in use and that the AP is plugged into a gigabit switch.

